{"unit_id":"zhujiuyi__dsh-balance-meter#feature-1","repo":"zhujiuyi/dsh-balance-meter","commit":"3f5f4214131d83ce9890b9d674005f89d5a6d5a7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@zhujiuyi/dsh-balance 的功能「当前路由余额查询」：按会话实际使用的模型路由读取供应商 API 余额或订阅余量。agent 可调用 balance_check，也可指定路由并要求强制刷新，结果包含额度和查询状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin/index.mjs:505-556","plugin/index.mjs:494-503"]}
